      "case_id": "qa_0000",
      "question": "What does the document say about dosage and administration?",
      "expected_answer": "Directions • adults 18 years of age and older • this product is to be used once a day (every 24 hours), every day for 14 days • may take 1 to 4 days for full effect 14-Day Course of Treatment • swallow 1 capsule with a glass of water before eating in the morning • take every day for 14 days • do not take more than 1 capsule a day • swallow whole. Do not crush or chew capsules. • do not use for more than 14 days unless directed by your doctor Repeated 14-Day Courses (if needed) • you may repeat a 14-day course every 4 months • do not take for more than 14 days or more often than every 4 months unless directed by a doctor • children under 18 years of age: ask a doctor before use. Heartburn in children may sometimes be caused by a serious condition.",
      "answerable": true,
      "case_type": "section",
      "source_field": "dosage_and_administration",
      "partition": "development",
      "source_record_id": "2425f611-2717-4486-aff3-82190c0b0d96",
